<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Plan of Action & Milestones (POA&M) — {{ company_name }}</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: "Times New Roman", serif; max-width: 11in; margin: 0.75in auto; line-height: 1.6; color: #1a1a1a; }
  h1 { font-size: 22px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 12px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #999; padding: 6px 10px; text-align: left; }
  th { background: #1e293b; color: white; }
  .priority-high { color: #dc2626; font-weight: bold; }
  .priority-med { color: #d97706; font-weight: bold; }
  .priority-low { color: #16a34a; font-weight: bold; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>PLAN OF ACTION & MILESTONES (POA&M)</h1>
<p><strong>Organization:</strong> {{ company_name }} | <strong>Date:</strong> {{ prepared_date }} | <strong>CMMC Level:</strong> {{ cmmc_level }}</p>

<table>
  <tr>
    <th>#</th>
    <th>Control ID</th>
    <th>Weakness/Deficiency</th>
    <th>POA&M Corrective Action</th>
    <th>Resources Required</th>
    <th>Scheduled Completion</th>
    <th>Milestone Changes</th>
    <th>Status</th>
    <th>Priority</th>
  </tr>
  {% for item in poam_items %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
    <td>{{ item.control_id }}</td>
    <td>{{ item.weakness }}</td>
    <td>{{ item.corrective_action }}</td>
    <td>{{ item.resources }}</td>
    <td>{{ item.scheduled_completion }}</td>
    <td>{{ item.milestone_changes }}</td>
    <td>{{ item.status }}</td>
    <td class="priority-{{ item.priority }}">{{ item.priority|upper }}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  {% if not poam_items %}
  <tr>
    <td>1</td>
    <td><em>[Control ID]</em></td>
    <td><em>[Description of weakness]</em></td>
    <td><em>[Planned corrective action]</em></td>
    <td><em>[Personnel, tools, budget]</em></td>
    <td><em>[Target date]</em></td>
    <td><em>[Any changes]</em></td>
    <td>Open</td>
    <td class="priority-high">HIGH</td>
  </tr>
  {% endif %}
</table>

<h2>Instructions</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Identify all NIST SP 800-171 controls not yet fully implemented</li>
  <li>For each deficiency, document the corrective action plan</li>
  <li>Assign resources, responsible parties, and completion dates</li>
  <li>POA&M must be completed within 180 days of Conditional Level 2 status</li>
  <li>Review and update monthly until all items are resolved</li>
</ol>

</body>
</html>
